 "notes": "H-DIE-R8 (coordinator 0dg, owner H-DIE-R8): the monolithic SU programme su_prog (ot_hbm_su_programme, 301 macros, no slot) is replaced by the partition of ot_hbm_su_programme_part (PARTS 4, DEPTH 2, PIPE 2): instance su_prog keeps its name (the F1 relay bus rf0435 col_su -> su_prog cfg/start/length lands on the same port names) and is remastered to the closed root ot_hbm_su_programme_root_h (slot su_pgr); producers pgp_<q> = ot_hbm_su_programme_pslice_q4 beside their quarters. busy/valid/done/edge_index come from producer 0 (pgp_SW) as in the part wrapper; producers 1..3 status outputs are open (ROLE). LATENCY: start -> command S+DEPTH+4+4 = S+10 vs monolithic S+4 -> compiler issues start 6 edges earlier (DEPTH 2 + PIPE 2 4); priced, no rate change (start advance is overlapped with the previous programme, fixed-cycle)."
